    "4bit only has a few entries and if catagorical analysis is performed, will be excluded. In bfloat16 and float16, both show similar right-skews for co2_cost, and bfloat16 show slightly higher emissions in log scale. This difference is likely confounding however, as bfloat16 is commonly used in larger models. "
